{title: Goodness Of God (Bondade de Deus) EN}
{artist: Bethel Music}
{tempo: 68}
{time: 4/4}

{c: Intro}
[Gsus4]

{c: Verse 1}
[G]I love You, Lord
[C]Your mercy never [G]fails me
[D/F#]All my days, [Em]
[C]I've been held in Your [D]hands
[G]From the moment that I [C]wake up
[G]Till I [D/F#]lay my [Em]head
[C]I will sing [D]of the goodness of [G]God

{c: Chorus}
[C]All my life You have been [G]faithful
[C]All my life You have been so, so [G]good [D]
[C]With every breath that I am [Em]able
[C]I will sing [D]of the goodness of [G]God

{c: Verse 2}
[G]I love Your voice
[C]You have led me through the [G]fire
[D/F#]In darkest night [Em]
[C]You are close like no [D]other
[Em]I've known You as my [C]Father
[G]I've known You as a [D/F#]friend [Em]
[C]I have lived [D]in the goodness of [G]God

{c: Bridge}
[G/B]Your goodness is running [C]after
[D]It's running after [G]me
[G/B]With my life laid down, I'm [C]surrendered now
[D]I give You [Em]everything
